{"title":"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">2006 AMC 12A #3</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">2006 AMC 10A #3</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The ratio of Mary's age to Alice's age is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/41281174060fd95dee9dac239ba24691436e388b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3:5$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />. Alice is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> years old. How old is Mary?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/7/2f79379aec9c041309b7f79e79dd6039fd2b8174.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 15\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 18\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 20\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 24\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\  50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> be Mary's age. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/6/d369fe592c8435bd5dded198fe170c84348501e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{30}=\\frac{3}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/7/1774aa5c868266291741603c77dfbf9777fa6af1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }18}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"111\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can see this is a combined ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fd84b9bc443979f4884ac1090e8df7fe30228ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5+3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" />. We can equalize by doing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/b/29b6b8fe8294c041cdba861d98781c5b2ac2ee89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\div5=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/a/e6a436391517fd35065f1e29f14102efeddc157a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\cdot3=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"122\" height=\"30\" />. With the common ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and difference ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e81f7ada3870ea3347d55decf29c712a3d3134a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\cdot8=30+18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"113\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, we can see our answer is correct.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n